,{"bioguideId":"F000474","fullName":"Rep. Flood, Mike [R-NE-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-03-25","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NE"},{"bioguideId":"A000380","fullName":"Rep. Amo, Gabe [D-RI-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-04-06","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"RI"},{"bioguideId":"C001137","fullName":"Rep. Crank, Jeff [R-CO-5]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-04-15","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CO"},{"bioguideId":"S001195","fullName":"Rep. Smith, Jason [R-MO-8]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-04-20","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MO"},{"bioguideId":"M001240","fullName":"Rep. McDowell, Addison P. [R-NC-6]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-04-20","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"M001236","fullName":"Rep. Moore, Tim [R-NC-14]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-04-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"S000168","fullName":"Rep. Salazar, Maria Elvira [R-FL-27]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-05-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"FL"},{"bioguideId":"V000136","fullName":"Rep. Vasquez, Gabe [D-NM-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-05-12","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NM"},{"bioguideId":"R000305","fullName":"Rep. Ross, Deborah K. [D-NC-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-06-30","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"S001228","fullName":"Rep. Schmidt, Derek [R-KS-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-07-20","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"KS"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T18:14:58+00:00","id":"hr6998-119","introducedDate":"2026-01-09","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-01-13","text":"Ordered to be Reported (Amended) by Voice Vote."},"laws":[],"number":"6998","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Crime and Law Enforcement","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"L000597","district":15,"fullName":"Rep. Lee, Laurel M. [R-FL-15]","party":"R","state":"FL"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2026-01-09","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Renewed Hope Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) to hire additional personnel, enhance coordination among agencies, and&nbsp;establish a training program to support child sexual exploitation investigations within  Homeland Security Investigations (HSI). HSI is the principle investigative arm of DHS and has broad authority to investigate a wide range of illegal activities, including child sexual exploitation.</p><p>Specifically, this bill directs DHS to hire, train, and assign 200 forensic analysts and child exploitation investigators to the&nbsp;Victim Identification Laboratory and to&nbsp;field offices throughout the United States to support the identification of victims of child sexual exploitation. The bill provides direct-hire authority (i.e., an expedited hiring authority) to DHS for the purpose of hiring such personnel.</p><p>Additionally, the bill requires DHS to establish joint procedures to coordinate the&nbsp;efforts of various&nbsp;agencies within&nbsp;DHS with HSI's Cyber Crimes Center in child sexual exploitation investigations.&nbsp;The bill also&nbsp;authorizes the Cyber Crimes Center to establish joint procedures to coordinate with the National Center for Missing &amp; Exploited Children (NCMEC) in child sexual exploitation investigations.</p><p>Finally, the bill directs DHS to establish a Victim Identification Training Program in the Cyber Crimes Center to help HSI personnel; federal state, local, tribal, and foreign law enforcement agency personnel; civil service organizations; and the NCMEC identify victims of sexual exploitation and abuse.&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2026-11-20T16:54:50Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Renewed Hope Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-11-20T16:56:58Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-11-20T16:56:58Z"}
